  cat > "${GUEST_HOME}/.local/share/sounds/sanctuary/README.txt" <<'SNDEOF'
Redstone 9X system sounds — this is your C:\Windows\Media.
Drop user-supplied files named <event>.wav (or .ogg/.flac/.mp3):
  startup logoff error question notify
  device-connect device-disconnect recycle-empty
Missing files are silent no-ops. Played by sanctuary-sound.
